# Pinned weights for Meta Llama Prompt Guard 2 22M, served by promptguard/server.py.
#
# Source repo:  project-free-llama/Llama-Prompt-Guard-2-22M  (NON-GATED mirror)
# Revision:     98f241c60b7999ba67eb8603f548461b577b3bc9
#
# Meta's canonical repo meta-llama/Llama-Prompt-Guard-2-22M is GATED: an anonymous fetch answers
# 401, and there is no HF_TOKEN on node-8 or in the deploy environment. This mirror serves the same
# DebertaV2ForSequenceClassification weights (hidden_size 384, 12 layers, vocab 128100) anonymously.
# The digests below were computed from a local download of that exact revision; the build FAILS if
# a single byte differs, so "the model we measured" and "the model in production" cannot diverge.
#
# Format is sha256sum's own: `<digest>  <filename>` so `sha256sum -c model.sha256` is the check.
# `checklist.chk`, `LICENSE`, `MODEL_CARD.md` and `USE_POLICY.md` are not needed to run the model and
# are deliberately NOT pinned here (fetch-model.sh downloads only what this file lists).
